  "title": "chainpeek: protocol fees and revenue over 24 hours, 7 days, 30 days, 1 year and all time (cached DefiLlama data)"
 },
 "description": "chainpeek: Get protocol fees and revenue. For TVL use get_protocol_tvl. Returns a protocol's fees and revenue in USD over 24 hours, 7 days, 30 days, 1 year and all time, the change, the revenue-to-fees ratio and DefiLlama's definitions, from Tanod's cache of DefiLlama data. Cached DefiLlama data (refreshed every few hours), never live; `as_of` shows its age; revenue is DefiLlama's definition (see methodology); an unknown protocol is a 422 with suggestions and a missing or over-2-day-old cache a 503 (neither charged). Informational only. Typically under 1 s (a local cache read). Price: USD 0.002. Free: 10 chain reads per IP per UTC day. Docs: https://tanod.dev/learn/defi-data-api.html",
 "inputSchema": {
  "properties": {
   "protocol": {
    "description": "Protocol (or chain) name or slug, e.g. aave, uniswap, lido, ethereum (a parent such as aave sums its versions). An unknown name is a 422 with suggestions.",
